  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童城堡房子DIY拼插组装套装",
    "en": "Kids Castle House DIY Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向跨境渠道的儿童城堡房子DIY拼插组装套装，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动和儿童游戏区空间搭建。\n\n品牌为其他，产品类别为益智类，主要适配速卖通、独立站和LAZADA等渠道，重点销售区域覆盖东南亚、北美、东北亚和中东。",
    "en": "This is a kids castle-house DIY building set designed for cross-border channels, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and children’s play-area setup.\n\nBrand: Other. Category: educational toy. It is mainly positioned for AliExpress, independent sites, and LAZADA, with key markets in Southeast Asia, North America, Northeast Asia, and the Middle East."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童城堡房子DIY拼插组装套装采用插珠式拼搭结构，可用于搭建帐篷、房屋和创意活动空间，适合亲子互动和教学场景使用。",
      "产品定位益智类拼搭玩具，强调动手参与和空间构建。主要面向跨境电商平台供货，便于多地区市场进行同款分销。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，外箱参考尺寸45 x 35 x 9cm，包装重量1500g。原始“专利及著作权申请时间”字段为异常值，已保留为未标注说明。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids castle-house DIY set uses a bead-style building structure and can be assembled into tents, house-like forms, and creative activity spaces for parent-child and educational scenarios.",
      "The product is positioned as an educational construction toy with a focus on hands-on participation and spatial building. It is mainly supplied to cross-border e-commerce platforms for multi-region distribution.",
      "It comes in a color box with a reference carton size of 45 x 35 x 9cm and a package weight of 1500g. The original patent filing-time field contains an abnormal value and is retained as unspecified."
    ]
  },
